  [PASS] J4: retrying automatically recovers within the guaranteed bound (at most 9 failed retries for this quorum shape), without any human manually intervening beyond following the documented protocol -- recovered after 6 retry round(s) following the initial failure
  [PASS] J5: once every subset has been reported as tried, the service returns a clear terminal failure (409), not a fabricated success -- got HTTP 409 (expected 409): {"error":"every reachable 3-node combination has already been tried and failed (10 tried) -- likely more than this quorum's fault-tolerance budget of bad nodes for this request"}
